>how are the nasty weapons created in 3.0?

hmmm ... perhaps the most accessible method is thru extreme devotion
to your god. offering sacrifices at your altar improves your standing
with your god. in the extreme, when you offer a sacrifice the gods may
reward you with an object which appears at your feet. this could be
Excalibur, Stormbringer, Snickersnee etc ...

